    "statement": "theorem direct_small_prime_source_certificate : (∀ (F K : Type) [Field F] [Fintype F] [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F), W.Δ≠0 → 3∣Nat.card W.Point → ¬3∣Fintype.card F-1 → ∀ k : ℕ,Fintype.card K=Fintype.card F^k → (Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange K))=9 ↔ 3∣Fintype.card F^k-1)) ∧ (∀ (F K : Type) [Field F] [Fintype F] [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F), W.Δ≠0 → 2∣Nat.card W.Point → ¬2∣Fintype.card F-1 → ∀ k : ℕ,Fintype.card K=Fintype.card F^k → (Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion (W.baseChange K))=4 ↔ 2∣Fintype.card F^k-1)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 2] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K), W.Δ≠0 → (Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion W)=1 ∨ Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion W)=2) ∧ Finite (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion W) ∧ Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion W)≠4) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 2] [Finite K], (TwoTorsionRankAudit.ordinaryModel K).Δ=1 ∧ (TwoTorsionRankAudit.supersingularModel K).Δ=1 ∧ Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion (TwoTorsionRankAudit.ordinaryModel K))=2 ∧ Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion (TwoTorsionRankAudit.supersingularModel K))=1 ∧ 2∣Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.ordinaryModel K).Point)",
    "decl_sha256": "ea39995c5361a59c3a610b1ae7cbd8bab659e0b4b77c9f70a5c5c2abea4f0cdb",
    "scope": "Direct original Balasubramanian–Koblitz finite-field count criteria at primes2and3. EveryfiniteF/K/actualAlgebraFK/arbitrarynonsingularWeierstrassmodel/actualpointcarddivisibler/rnotdividingq−1/extensioncardq^k: exactlyr²actualpoints killedr includingidentity iff r|q^k−1. No suppliedauxiliaryalgclosure/embedding/tower/coprimality/normalization/rank/determinant/pairing. Construct canonicalAlgebraicClosureK/AlgebraF/tower internallyforprime3 and reuse originalcriterion. Prime2q−1conditionforceschar2, actualkilled2subgroupovereverychar2fieldcard1or2/finiteness/never4, cyclotomicfalse; sourcepointcountpremisepreservedbutunneededforr2. Creditedactualchar2Delta1models/card2and1/ordinary2dividespointcard realizebranches. Generalprime3count/rankclassificationandallpreviousproofscredited. Otherprimes>=5/canonicalWeil/fullallkp500/SSdefinition-trace/original14remainopen. Noqualifiedsourcerefutation/fullsource-read/novelty/corpuspromotion/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
